<title>HONG KONG: Wai Kee interim net rises sharply.</title>
<headline>Wai Kee interim net rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   9.58   vs 3.71</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0    vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    62.13  vs 22.13</p>
<p>    Turnover		     457.85 vs 339.38</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wai Kee Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  December 4-10</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   December 13</p>
<p>NOTE - Wai Kee is a civil engineering group.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
